        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nMy advice would be to press `<C-v>` prior to any pair-specific character if you want it to be inserted literally.\r\n\r\nIf you don't want to do that, having this type of autocommand is the way to go. But don't forget to  also reenable pairs on `RecordingLeave` event. As to how disable them on replaying, there is no event for that (yet, see neovim/neovim#24565).\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
